WEBVTT

00:05.970 --> 00:08.600
I'm so happy you're still alive.

00:09.340 --> 00:11.310
Mother...

00:16.440 --> 00:18.080
What's wrong?

00:18.080 --> 00:19.710
Mother!

00:25.350 --> 00:27.160
You're...

00:27.160 --> 00:28.950
Roya!

00:29.820 --> 00:37.570
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:37.570 --> 00:44.530
Towards a far, faraway place

00:57.890 --> 01:04.090
Blown by the wind, we walk on

01:04.090 --> 01:11.060
Wanting to know the reason we were born

01:11.270 --> 01:17.570
Even if a time of loss should come

01:17.570 --> 01:24.710
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

01:27.150 --> 01:34.560
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:34.560 --> 01:40.530
Towards something we can't lose

01:40.530 --> 01:48.170
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:48.170 --> 01:55.040
Towards a far, faraway place

02:05.320 --> 02:07.950
Prepare to die, Roya!

02:12.930 --> 02:14.550
Die!

02:18.370 --> 02:19.990
Cloud?!

02:20.640 --> 02:22.640
You're...

02:22.640 --> 02:24.210
Roya!

02:24.210 --> 02:25.340
Zed!

02:25.340 --> 02:26.740
What's going on here?!

02:26.740 --> 02:28.710
Take the girl and run!

02:31.050 --> 02:32.750
I won't let you get away!

02:32.750 --> 02:34.280
Hurry!

02:34.280 --> 02:35.050
Roya!

02:35.050 --> 02:36.780
No! Mother!
Roya!

02:36.780 --> 02:38.150
Mother!

02:38.150 --> 02:39.780
Stop!

02:40.990 --> 02:42.620
Bastard!

02:46.330 --> 02:47.950
Mother...

02:48.800 --> 02:51.400
What the heck happened back there?

02:51.400 --> 02:53.700
For now, let's get you back
to Norman's mansion.

02:57.240 --> 02:59.710
You've gone over to Norman's side?

02:59.710 --> 03:01.500
Just what is your aim?!

03:03.580 --> 03:04.250
Jesara...

03:04.250 --> 03:06.540
Traitor!
Jesara...

03:15.790 --> 03:16.790
Cloud!

03:16.790 --> 03:20.790
Episode 23
Bonds

03:16.790 --> 03:18.130


Cloud!

03:26.630 --> 03:28.430
Are you certain?

03:29.070 --> 03:32.740
Yeah, there's no mistaking those eyes.

03:32.740 --> 03:35.040
They were just like in my memories.

03:36.410 --> 03:38.040
But...

03:40.110 --> 03:41.740
Roya!

03:42.880 --> 03:46.680
...why did her kind expression change like that?

04:02.040 --> 04:04.000
Roya!

04:04.810 --> 04:07.310
So, she's got, like, multiple personalities?

04:07.310 --> 04:09.110
I don't know.

04:11.080 --> 04:15.050
Does my mother hate me?

04:15.050 --> 04:16.680
Roya...

04:16.680 --> 04:19.250
Does she hate me so much that
she wants to kill me?

04:19.250 --> 04:20.590
Roya!

04:20.590 --> 04:22.560
What am I?!

04:22.560 --> 04:27.020
I just don't know what's what anymore!

04:38.640 --> 04:40.440
Who's that?

04:44.980 --> 04:46.610
You?!

04:47.980 --> 04:52.290
What? Roya was a sacrifice for the sacred rite?!

04:52.290 --> 04:55.420
And is this the truth?

04:55.420 --> 04:56.820
Of course it is.

04:56.820 --> 05:01.120
The rite was being conducted
by King Gari himself.

05:01.760 --> 05:06.230
But a shard caster appeared in our
midst during the ritual,

05:06.230 --> 05:09.100
and took away the sacrifice!

05:09.100 --> 05:13.060
He ruined the rite and defiled the holy ground!

05:16.910 --> 05:21.650
That woman has made a mockery of
King Gari and Great Tusker!

05:21.650 --> 05:24.990
She cannot be allowed to live.

05:24.990 --> 05:28.320
I acquired the girl in order to corner Moloch.

05:28.320 --> 05:30.620
I never thought she'd be anything of that nature.

05:32.890 --> 05:34.830
I submit her to the king!

05:34.830 --> 05:36.900
Have Roya detained immediately!

05:36.900 --> 05:38.530
Yes, sir!

05:39.330 --> 05:42.170
Roya is the "accursed child"?

05:42.170 --> 05:46.630
To me she could not have been
a greater blessing!

05:49.380 --> 05:51.180
St..Stay back!

05:51.180 --> 05:52.350
Be gone!

05:52.350 --> 05:54.880
You should have died ten years ago!

05:54.880 --> 05:57.850
Be gone! Be gone! Be gone!

05:59.420 --> 06:01.220
Master Moloch?

06:08.160 --> 06:09.960
Master Moloch?

06:11.270 --> 06:13.060
Je..Jesara!

06:13.800 --> 06:15.430
Jesara?

06:25.150 --> 06:27.770
Who the heck are you?

06:29.520 --> 06:32.650
Have you heard of individuals that
are known as "Jokers"?

06:32.650 --> 06:35.280
Yeah, they're spies.

06:36.120 --> 06:38.930
I am a Joker for Templar.

06:38.930 --> 06:40.560
What did you say?!

06:40.560 --> 06:41.760
Are you serious?

06:41.760 --> 06:45.220
Yeah, I am here to find out the true
state of affairs in Tusk.

06:46.000 --> 06:50.630
Is that why you've helped us out a few times?

06:53.310 --> 06:57.110
Then, that time in Kalb-Hu you knocked
me away deliberately?

07:03.580 --> 07:05.380
Please tell me!

07:06.220 --> 07:09.190
You know my mother, don't you?

07:11.690 --> 07:16.490
I have come here to tell you about Jesara.

07:17.060 --> 07:18.330
Jesara?

07:18.330 --> 07:20.960
That is your mother's name.

07:22.770 --> 07:26.110
Then, who is that woman, Despara?

07:26.110 --> 07:28.080
What's going on here?

07:29.840 --> 07:31.980
It all began ten years ago,

07:31.980 --> 07:37.610
when the seer, Gredieff, came before Moloch.

07:40.620 --> 07:41.990
Don't hand me that!

07:41.990 --> 07:44.090
Roya is my daughter!

07:44.090 --> 07:47.160
Calm yourself, Moloch, my lord.

07:47.160 --> 07:49.000
The nerve!

07:49.000 --> 07:53.030
You're telling me that Roya is an accursed
child who will be my downfall?!

07:53.030 --> 07:57.000
I have imparted the prophecy
unto you, no more.

07:57.000 --> 08:01.960
Whether or not you believe me
is entirely up to you!

08:11.920 --> 08:13.650
How ridiculous.

08:13.650 --> 08:16.620
That Roya would bring ruin upon me...

08:23.460 --> 08:25.760
Here you go, Father!

08:27.200 --> 08:29.330
Thank you, Roya.

08:32.710 --> 08:34.680
Is something the matter?

08:34.680 --> 08:36.800
Why, no!

09:19.090 --> 09:21.710
Roya, why would you...

09:22.590 --> 09:25.890
Here you go, Father!

09:26.490 --> 09:29.130
Why would you...

09:29.130 --> 09:31.100
Why would you destroy me?!

09:37.810 --> 09:42.210
I am losing my mind!

09:42.210 --> 09:46.840
Dare I mention that I've heard
Gredieff's predictions are certain?

09:47.880 --> 09:50.850
You cross the line, servant!

09:52.520 --> 09:57.460
If it is your wish, I will find Roya and...

09:57.460 --> 09:59.130
What?

09:59.130 --> 10:02.430
I shall protect you, Master Moloch.

10:07.940 --> 10:09.560
Despara...

10:12.110 --> 10:15.080
It... It can't be.

10:21.350 --> 10:24.120
No! Mother!

10:24.120 --> 10:26.320
Mother!

10:26.320 --> 10:29.290
Why do you harbor such malice for Roya?!

10:31.130 --> 10:34.400
Her father wishes for her death.

10:34.400 --> 10:36.020
That...

10:36.730 --> 10:38.700
That cannot be!

10:40.070 --> 10:43.140
I am only fulfilling Master Moloch's request.

10:43.140 --> 10:48.100
And I shall take your social
standing and prestige.

10:51.150 --> 10:53.110
What unpleasant eyes!

10:55.280 --> 10:57.410
Roya! Stay back!

11:03.120 --> 11:05.590
Mother!

11:06.690 --> 11:08.660
Roya!

11:11.200 --> 11:14.670
This is quite an end for you, Jesara!

11:14.670 --> 11:17.300
Now, go be with your daughter
on the other side!

11:19.440 --> 11:25.400
I believe that you are still alive, Roya.

11:34.190 --> 11:36.490
Wh..What are you?!

11:48.540 --> 11:51.160
What did my mother do?

11:52.010 --> 11:57.610
Jesara used that shard to transfer
her soul into Despara.

11:57.610 --> 12:01.120
She did that with a shard?

12:01.120 --> 12:03.240
You can do that?

12:05.990 --> 12:09.160
Jesara lived on within Despara,

12:09.160 --> 12:11.230
believing that you were still alive,

12:11.230 --> 12:15.700
and determined that the next time you were
in peril that she would protect you.

12:15.700 --> 12:21.000
And you were alive, just as Jesara had believed.

12:21.000 --> 12:23.700
That reminds me of something the old man said.

12:23.700 --> 12:28.040
He told me that he brought you back
from Tusk ten years ago.

12:28.040 --> 12:31.500
He must have saved you after you fell off the cliff.

12:32.810 --> 12:34.440
Roya...

12:35.080 --> 12:37.450
I want you to etch love for your
mother into your heart,

12:37.450 --> 12:40.620
rather than hatred for your father.

12:40.620 --> 12:44.390
And the miracle of life that Jesara's
love brought about.

12:44.390 --> 12:47.190
Miracle of life...

12:48.660 --> 12:55.770
I wanted to fulfill the wishes that Jesara
held so dearly for ten years.

12:55.770 --> 13:00.070
I wanted to let her protect you herself.

13:00.070 --> 13:01.740
Cloud...

13:01.740 --> 13:05.880
But Jesara's plan fell apart.

13:05.880 --> 13:12.350
With you there before her, Despara's tenacity
overwhelmed Jesara's wish.

13:12.350 --> 13:16.650
Jesara was unable to destroy Despara.

13:17.860 --> 13:20.830
Despara will likely make another
attempt on your life.

13:20.830 --> 13:24.130
That is why you must return
to Templar right away!

13:24.970 --> 13:27.330
That is no doubt what Jesara desires as well.

13:27.330 --> 13:29.130
I will not allow it.

13:32.970 --> 13:35.240
Roya is my adopted daughter.

13:35.240 --> 13:38.540
I cannot have her acting however she pleases.

13:42.250 --> 13:45.790
What a terrible way to treat me
after all I've done for you.

13:45.790 --> 13:49.190
You were able to see your mother thanks to me.

13:49.190 --> 13:52.630
Now, I will have you be of use to me.

13:52.630 --> 13:54.250
Mr. Norman...

13:55.460 --> 13:57.090
Damn!

13:58.930 --> 14:00.730
Amir Gaul!

14:01.900 --> 14:03.870
Releasing a spirit in here?!

14:07.270 --> 14:09.570
This was that young man's spirit?

14:16.780 --> 14:18.750
Now's your chance! Go!

14:26.890 --> 14:28.690
This spirit...

14:36.570 --> 14:39.370
Get in my way, will you?

15:17.440 --> 15:19.240
Are you okay?

15:20.210 --> 15:21.840
Yes!

15:23.880 --> 15:25.850
You are indeed your mother's daughter.

15:27.250 --> 15:29.220
Your eyes are just like hers.

15:30.620 --> 15:32.420
Like my mother's?

15:37.400 --> 15:40.700
Cloud, you love my mother, don't you?

15:47.940 --> 15:52.280
I had gotten close to Moloch in order
to better carry out my mission,

15:52.280 --> 15:55.250
rising high enough in the ranks to become
Despara's personal aide.

15:57.150 --> 15:58.950
Then, one day...

16:01.520 --> 16:03.650
Is it another one of your headaches?

16:04.930 --> 16:06.720
Lady Despara?

16:12.870 --> 16:18.000
She had a kind expression and gentle
smile entirely unlike Despara.

16:19.140 --> 16:22.680
That was my first encounter with Jesara.

16:22.680 --> 16:26.810
Jesara had lived in secret, so as
not to be discovered.

16:27.650 --> 16:29.820
She endured great anxiety and solitude,

16:29.820 --> 16:33.120
believing that the time would come
when she would protect you.

16:41.230 --> 16:42.860
Jesara...

16:44.630 --> 16:49.590
As difficult a tale as hers was to believe,
I accepted Jesara.

16:53.770 --> 16:56.610
I guess that makes me a failure as a Joker.

16:56.610 --> 16:58.410
Cloud...

16:59.680 --> 17:02.050
I've found you.

17:02.050 --> 17:03.650
You...

17:03.650 --> 17:06.780
Killing you will release me from this agony!

17:08.560 --> 17:10.520
It's true, isn't it?!

17:13.130 --> 17:15.250
This futile struggle ends now!

17:16.900 --> 17:18.870
There's still more of them?

17:25.340 --> 17:27.310
Oh, no you don't!

17:41.890 --> 17:43.860
No! Cloud!

17:44.360 --> 17:48.060
If worse comes to worst, I will kill
Despara and protect you.

17:48.060 --> 17:50.230
That is a promise I made to Jesara.

17:50.230 --> 17:54.030
No! But she's my mother, isn't she?!

17:55.100 --> 17:57.400
Please stop this!

18:04.750 --> 18:06.710
Wh..What is it?

18:06.710 --> 18:08.850
What's happening?

18:08.850 --> 18:10.820
It seems as though they're being
drawn to something.

18:13.090 --> 18:14.290
Roya!

18:14.290 --> 18:17.090
No! Let go of me!

18:17.090 --> 18:18.890
Master Moloch!

18:19.930 --> 18:23.260
This man is my father?!

18:23.260 --> 18:25.230
I will no longer rely on anyone else!

18:26.500 --> 18:31.960
I can't trust anyone but myself!

19:04.000 --> 19:05.800
Mother!

19:06.540 --> 19:08.170
Mother!

19:09.110 --> 19:11.580
Mother! Mother!

19:12.110 --> 19:15.570
Mother! Mother!

19:19.350 --> 19:21.220
Roya...

19:21.220 --> 19:23.020
Mother...

19:23.920 --> 19:28.880
Roya, I was finally able to protect you.

19:32.270 --> 19:33.890
Mother!

19:56.460 --> 20:00.420
I'm counting on you guys, Amir Gaul, Rambos!

20:15.010 --> 20:16.980
Sorry to keep you waiting.

20:18.310 --> 20:20.610
Zed! Are you all right?

20:25.690 --> 20:29.320
The two of you must return to Templar now
while you have the chance.

20:29.320 --> 20:31.060
While we have the chance?

20:31.060 --> 20:32.460
That's right.

20:32.460 --> 20:36.920
The Beastmen were drawn by Amir Gaul
and have gathered together.

20:37.600 --> 20:39.900
Then, you come with us, Mother!

20:41.600 --> 20:45.210
The light of this life will soon be extinguished.

20:45.210 --> 20:47.000
What do you mean?

20:47.840 --> 20:51.970
Despara's soul is no longer in this world.

20:52.780 --> 20:57.410
This is a miracle of life that
you have granted me.

20:59.720 --> 21:01.350
Mother...

21:03.490 --> 21:05.460
I love you.

21:06.890 --> 21:12.200
Now and forever, I shall always love you.

21:14.170 --> 21:15.960
Mother...

21:19.410 --> 21:21.530
What will you do?

21:33.320 --> 21:34.950
Mother!

21:38.330 --> 21:41.290
Be well, Roya!

21:46.970 --> 21:48.590
Jesara!

21:49.800 --> 21:53.310
It seems I must now part with you too.

21:53.310 --> 21:55.430
I won't leave you alone.

21:58.310 --> 22:01.440
Thank you, Cloud.

22:03.280 --> 22:06.910
You live on...

22:08.420 --> 22:10.050
Jesara...

22:10.960 --> 22:12.580
Jesara!

22:42.020 --> 22:44.620
Open the hands you have over your face

22:44.620 --> 22:47.460
It looks like you'll be done in by the sun

22:47.460 --> 22:52.420
Let's let the sky melt away our melancholy

22:52.770 --> 22:58.410
We stripped off our heavy jackets
and started running, 6, 7, 8

22:58.410 --> 23:04.370
So, we'll make the wind blow in this
windless place, and take off! Go!

23:09.420 --> 23:14.820
I'm shaken awake, head spinning,
and sunlight hits me the next moment

23:14.820 --> 23:18.620
The rain's abatement lets loose dreams

23:20.330 --> 23:23.060
We'll dash down this path

23:23.060 --> 23:30.530
Search for the one-and-only "now"
and our heartbeats

23:31.200 --> 23:33.870
Thrust out our clasped hands

23:33.870 --> 23:36.640
It looks like we could even shatter the sun

23:36.640 --> 23:41.600
Let's launch our melancholy into the sky

23:42.120 --> 23:47.650
Try again, step forward, if we're hesitating 7, 8, 9

23:47.650 --> 23:53.790
We'll shout loud enough to echo
to Cloud Ten, and go!

24:17.580 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
The Yellow Shard of Happiness

24:17.580 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "The Yellow Shard of Happiness"
